{"seq":23,"slug":"policy-as-code","title":"策略即代码实践","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code","rating":{"composite":4.06,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"策略即代码实践-简介\">策略即代码实践 简介</h1><p>策略即代码（Policy as Code，PaC）是将组织的治理规则、安全要求和运维规范以声明式代码的形式定义、版本化和自动化执行的实践。在云原生和 DevOps 时代，基础设施和应用的交付速度越来越快，传统依赖人工审核和文档描述的治理方式已经无法跟上自动化交付的节奏。策略即代码通过将治理规则编码为可执行代码，实现了&quot;治理即自动化&quot;的转变。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向希望系统掌握策略即代码实践的 DevOps 工程师、SRE 和平台工程师。无论你是刚开始接触 OPA 的开发者、负责 Kubernetes 集群安全的平台工程师，还是希望建立组织级策略治理体系的技术负责人，这里都将为你提供从基础概念到生产运维的完整知识体系。</p>\n<p>全书围绕四条主线展开，覆盖策略即代码的完整实践栈：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>策略即代码基础</strong>从 PaC 的核心概念出发，系统讲解策略的类型与分类体系，以及策略引擎的架构模式和执行点。学完本章，你将理解&quot;什么是策略即代码&quot;和&quot;它在系统中处于什么位置&quot;。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>OPA 与 Rego 语言</strong>深入最主流的通用策略引擎 Open Policy Agent，讲解其架构组件和部署模式，并系统教授 Rego 声明式策略语言的语法基础和高级模式。这是动手编写策略的核心技术基础。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>PaC 平台与工具</strong>聚焦策略即代码的三大应用场景：Kubernetes 准入控制（Kyverno 与 OPA Gatekeeper）、基础设施即代码检查（Conftest 与 Sentinel）、以及 CI/CD 流水线中的策略门禁集成。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>PaC 运维与治理</strong>讨论策略体系的长期运维，包括策略测试与验证方法论、策略生命周期管理流程、以及策略可观测性与合规审计体系。</p>\n<p>建议按照章节顺序学习。如果你已有 Kubernetes 和 DevOps 基础，可以从第二章 OPA/Rego 开始动手实践；如果你主要关注 K8s 安全，可以直接进入第三章的准入控制部分；如果你负责策略体系的建设和运维，第四章的生命周期管理和可观测性内容会最为相关。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>前置知识：</strong> 本知识库假设读者具备 DevOps 基础概念和 Kubernetes 基础知识（Pod、Deployment、Namespace、API Server 等）。如果对这些概念还不熟悉，建议先补充云原生基础再进入策略即代码的学习。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pac-foundations","title":"策略即代码基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-policy-as-code","title":"什么是策略即代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-foundations/what-is-policy-as-code"},{"seq":2,"slug":"policy-types-categories","title":"策略类型与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-foundations/policy-types-categories"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pac-architecture","title":"PaC 架构与执行点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-foundations/pac-architecture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"opa-rego","title":"OPA 与 Rego 语言","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/opa-rego","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"opa-architecture","title":"OPA 架构与集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/opa-rego/opa-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rego-language-basics","title":"Rego 语言基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/opa-rego/rego-language-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rego-advanced-patterns","title":"Rego 高级模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/opa-rego/rego-advanced-patterns"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"pac-platforms","title":"PaC 平台与工具","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kubernetes-admission","title":"Kubernetes 准入控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-platforms/kubernetes-admission"},{"seq":2,"slug":"terraform-sentinel-conftest","title":"Terraform 与 Sentinel/Conftest","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-platforms/terraform-sentinel-conftest"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-cd-policy-gates","title":"CI/CD 策略门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-platforms/ci-cd-policy-gates"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"pac-operations","title":"PaC 运维与治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"policy-testing","title":"策略测试与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-operations/policy-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"policy-lifecycle","title":"策略生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-operations/policy-lifecycle"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pac-observability","title":"策略可观测性与审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-operations/pac-observability"}]}]}